      "writtenOn": "2021-10-05T17:49:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think if it\u0027s not a significant performance hit, I\u0027d actually rather the calculations be done by the test if they\u0027re known by the test. I think of it like compilable/testable documentation. In general, I strive to have code describe *what* I\u0027m doing and reserve comments *why* I\u0027m doing it.\n\nIt\u0027s also now an implicit relationship that could be made explicit with code. It\u0027s a fake scenario, but someone could make a change to one of operands and may forget to update this variable.",
      "parentUuid": "dd747156_a2b22ede",
